<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA BY TWO WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA BY TWO WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia</p>
<p>beat South Africa by two wickets on the fourth day of the second</p>
<p>test in Port Elizabeth on Monday, to take a winning 2-0 lead in</p>
<p>the three-test series.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 209 and 168, Australia 108 and 271-8</p>
<p>(Mark Waugh 116).</p>
</text>
